@startuml
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0056b3
    LifeLineBorderColor #555555
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #f8f9fa
    BoxBorderColor #cccccc
    GroupBorderColor #888888
    GroupBackgroundColor #fcfcfc
}

title Sequenzdiagramm: NutriQuest

actor "Benutzer" as User

box "Client (Frontend)" #FFF9E6
    participant "ScannerView" as Scanner
    participant "Dashboard / DiaryView" as UI
end box

box "Server (Backend)" #E6F2FF
    participant "NutritionService" as Nutri
    participant "AuthMiddleware" as Auth
    participant "User/Diary/Quest Controller" as Ctrl
end box

database "SQLite DB" as DB
collections "Open Food Facts\n(Externe API)" as ExtAPI

== 1. Barcode-Erkennung & API-Abfrage ==

User -> Scanner : Klickt "Barcode Scannen"
activate Scanner
Scanner -> Nutri : POST /api/scan { barcode: EAN }
activate Nutri
Nutri -> ExtAPI : GET /api/v0/product/{EAN}.json
ExtAPI --> Nutri : JSON-Nährwertdaten
Nutri --> Scanner : HTTP 200 { success: true, name, kcal }
deactivate Nutri

== 2. Benutzereingabe & Berechnung ==

Scanner -> User : Prompt: Grammanzahl eingeben
User --> Scanner : Eingabe bestätigt (z.B. 200g)
Scanner -> Scanner : Kalorien & XP berechnen\nLevel-Up prüfen

== 3. Persistierung ==

par User-Stammdaten aktualisieren
    Scanner -> Auth : POST /api/user/update [JWT]
    activate Auth
    Auth -> Ctrl : validiert & leitet weiter
    Ctrl -> DB : UPDATE users SET level, xp...
    Ctrl --> Auth : OK
    Auth --> Scanner : HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate Auth
else Tagebucheintrag sichern
    Scanner -> Auth : POST /api/diary/add [JWT]
    activate Auth
    Auth -> Ctrl : validiert & leitet weiter
    Ctrl -> DB : INSERT INTO diary_entries
    Ctrl --> Auth : OK
    Auth --> Scanner : HTTP 200 OK
    deactivate Auth
end

== 4. UI-Synchronisation & Tagesquests ==

Scanner -> UI : Re-Rendering anstoßen
deactivate Scanner
activate UI

UI -> Auth : GET /api/quests/{heute} [JWT]
activate Auth
Auth -> Ctrl : validiert & leitet weiter
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : SELECT COUNT(meals), SUM(kcal)
Ctrl -> DB : SELECT quest_id FROM daily_quests_claimed
Ctrl --> Auth : JSON (Sichere Quest-Regeln & Fortschritt)
deactivate Ctrl
Auth --> UI : HTTP 200 OK
deactivate Auth

UI -> UI : Ring-Chart füllen &\nQuest-Fortschrittsbalken rendern

UI --> User : Dashboard aktualisiert\n(neue XP, Liste & Quest-Status)
deactivate UI

@enduml